# Normain AB — Leyton follow-up answers (technical)

Period: July 2025 – April 2026  |  Drafted: 2026-05-08

Three follow-up questions were raised after reviewing the R&D Eligibility Assessment Checklist and the supporting materials in the shared Drive folder. Below are the answers, each followed by an explicit confidence statement.

